  91:./src/flash_if.c **** /**
  92:./src/flash_if.c ****  * @brief  This function writes a data buffer in flash (data are 32-bit aligned).
  93:./src/flash_if.c ****  * @note   After writing data buffer, the flash content is checked.
  94:./src/flash_if.c ****  * @param  FlashAddress: start address for writing data buffer
  95:./src/flash_if.c ****  * @param  Data: pointer on data buffer
  96:./src/flash_if.c ****  * @param  DataLength: length of data buffer (unit is 32-bit word)
